{"text": "Early in the morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The woman woke the children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Get up We are going into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To get wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She gave each child. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A small piece of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As they walked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel kept stopping. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And looking back at the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was secretly dropping. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The white pebbles on the path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the middle of the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The father made a big fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rest here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the woman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We will come back for you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children sat by the fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And ate their bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They heard an axe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So they thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Their father was near. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was only a branch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the wind was knocking it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Against a tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the moon rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They followed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The shining pebbles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All the way home.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "a", "r", "l", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "o", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "G", "e", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "W", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b"